 "answer_verbatim": "For a straightforward oil change, **SpeeDee Oil Change & Auto Service** is a convenient option: **44 Mission Dr., Pleasanton, CA 94566**. It offers a 17-point oil-change service, though its ratings are mixed—about **4.1/5 from 180 reviews** in the results I found.\n\nIf you’d rather use a general auto-repair shop, **Precision Auto Repair** at **164 Wyoming St.** has a strong overall rating (about **4.9/5 across 772 reviews**), but check that it can fit you in for an oil change and ask for the price first.\n\nWhichever you choose, confirm the oil type and total cost before authorizing any add-ons.",
